    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's definitely epic. it really leans into that sense of destiny. i was thinking about how to handle the more complicated parts of this era though—like the impact on the people already living there. do you think we should include that in this intro, or would that ruin the 'spirit of discovery' vibe we're going for?",
